  m_Name: Quest_NameOnTheRegister
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Data::EndlessDescent.Data.AuthoredQuestDefinition
  id: quest.act1.register
  title: The Name on the Register
  giver: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d0eaa6ab437133d89473d2dba27f1a9, type: 2}
  faction: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fba0a8fe9beb89c1f88b8c0dd2a76d54, type: 2}
  reason: The register is current for the first time in eleven years, and there is
    one name on it that was written after the lamp went out.
  complication: Somebody has been entering the dead before they died.
  availability: []
  stages:
  - Title: Ask him straight
    Summary: He has had eleven years to think about what he would say.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 3
      Description: Put it to Rowen Stagg
      Item: {fileID: 0}
      Npc: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d0eaa6ab437133d89473d2dba27f1a9, type: 2}
      Location: {fileID: 0}
      Enemy: {fileID: 0}
      Count: 1
    OnEnter: []
  - Title: Go where the name points
    Summary: Whoever wrote it did not expect anybody to go and look.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 4
      Description: Reach the Crypt, south-west of Ashmere
      Item: {fileID: 0}
      Npc: {fileID: 0}
      Location: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bad81b5c6d01c14de9f417031e2647b6, type: 2}
      Enemy: {fileID: 0}
      Count: 1
    OnEnter: []
  - Title: Finish it
    Summary: What is down there was put there on purpose.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 5
      Description: Clear what is waiting in the Crypt
      Item: {fileID: 0}
      Npc: {fileID: 0}
      Location: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bad81b5c6d01c14de9f417031e2647b6, type: 2}
      Enemy: {fileID: 0}
      Count: 1
    OnEnter: []
  - Title: Bring it back
    Summary: The Wardens will want the proof, not the story.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 2
      Description: Take it to Perrin Ossel
      Item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4526ad46a6d29cf6d8fcb2740ceeb639, type: 2}
      Npc: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ec4428bbdff2bfa3a15ad688555f7aa, type: 2}
      Location: {fileID: 0}
      Enemy: {fileID: 0}
      Count: 1
    OnEnter: []
